{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_1","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"孝景皇帝，〔一〕文帝太子也。母曰竇皇后。後七年六月，文帝崩。丁未，太子即皇帝位，尊皇太后薄氏曰太皇太后，皇后曰皇太后。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_2","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　荀悅曰：「諱啟之字曰開。」應劭曰：「禮諡法『布義行剛曰景』。」","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_3","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"九月，有星孛于西方。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_4","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"元年冬十月，詔曰：「蓋聞古者祖有功而宗有德，〔一〕制禮樂各有由。歌者，所以發德也；舞者，所以明功也。高廟酎，〔二〕奏武德、文始、五行之舞。〔三〕孝惠廟酎，奏文始、五行之舞。孝文皇帝臨天下，通關梁，不異遠方；〔四〕除誹謗，去肉刑，賞賜長老，收恤孤獨，以遂群生；〔五〕減耆欲，不受獻，〔六〕罪人不帑，〔七〕不誅亡罪，不私其利也；除宮刑，出美人，重絕人之世也。朕既不敏，弗能勝識。〔八〕此皆上世之所不及，而孝文皇帝親行之。〔九〕德厚侔天地，利澤施四海，〔一０〕靡不獲福。明象乎日月，而廟樂不稱，朕甚懼焉。〔一一〕其為孝文皇帝廟為昭德之舞，〔一二〕以明休德。〔一三〕然后祖宗之功德，施于萬世，永永無窮，朕甚嘉之。其與丞相、列侯、中二千石、禮官具禮儀奏。」丞相臣嘉等奏曰：〔一四〕「陛下永思孝道，立昭德之舞以明孝文皇帝之盛德，皆臣嘉等愚所不及。臣謹議：世功莫大於高皇帝，德莫盛於孝文皇帝。高皇帝廟宜為帝者太祖之廟，孝文皇帝廟宜為帝諸太宗之廟。天子宜世世獻祖宗之廟。郡國諸侯宜各為孝文皇帝立太宗之廟。諸侯王列侯使者侍祠天子所獻祖宗之廟。〔一五〕請宣布天下。」制曰「可」。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_5","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　應劭曰：「始取天下者為祖，高帝稱高祖是也。始治天下者為宗，文帝稱太宗是也。」師古曰：「應說非也。祖，始也，始受命也。宗，尊也，有德可尊。」","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_6","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　張晏曰：「正月旦作酒，八月成，名曰酎。酎之言純也。至武帝時，因八月嘗酎會諸侯廟中，出金助祭，所謂酎金也。」師古曰：「酎，三重釀，醇酒也，味厚，故以薦宗廟。酎音直救反。」","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_7","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　孟康曰：「武德，高祖所作也。文始，舜舞也。五行，周舞也。武德者，其舞人執干戚。文始舞執羽籥。五行舞冠冕，衣服法五行色。見禮樂志。」","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_8","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔四〕　張晏曰：「孝文十二年，除關不用傳，令遠近若一。」","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_9","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔五〕　師古曰：「遂，成也，達也。」","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_10","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔六〕　師古曰：「耆讀曰嗜。」","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_11","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔七〕　蘇林曰：「刑不及妻子。」師古曰：「帑讀與孥同。」","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_12","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔八〕　師古曰：「敏，材智速疾也。勝識，盡知之。」","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_13","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔九〕　師古曰：「上世，謂古昔之帝王也。」","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_14","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一０〕師古曰：「侔，等也，音牟。」","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_15","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一一〕師古曰：「稱，副也，音尺孕反。」","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_16","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一二〕師古曰：「昭，明也。」","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_17","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一三〕師古曰：「休，美也。」","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_18","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一四〕師古曰：「申屠嘉。」","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_19","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一五〕張晏曰：「王及列侯歲時遣使詣京師侍祠助祭。」如淳曰：「若光武廟在章陵，南陽太守稱使者往祭是也。不使侯王祭者，諸侯不得祖天子。凡臨祭宗廟皆為侍祭。」師古曰：「張說是也。既云天子所獻祖宗之廟，非謂郡國之廟也。」","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_20","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"春正月，詔曰：「間者歲比不登，民多乏食，夭絕天年，朕甚痛之。郡國或磽陿，無所農桑〈擊，去“手”〉畜；〔一〕或地饒廣，薦草莽，水泉利，而不得徙。〔二〕其議民欲徙寬大地者，聽之。」","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_21","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「磽謂磽埆瘠薄也。陿謂褊隘也。〈擊，去“手”〉謂食養之。畜謂牧放也。磽音苦交反。陿音狹。〈擊，去“手”〉古繫字。」","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_22","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　如淳曰：「莊周云麋鹿食曰薦。一曰草稠曰薦，深曰莽。」","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_23","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"夏四月，赦天下。賜民爵一級。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_24","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"遣御史大夫青翟至代下與匈奴和親。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_25","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　文穎曰：「姓嚴，諱青翟。」臣瓚曰：「此陶青也。莊青翟乃自武帝時人，此紀誤。」師古曰：「後人傳習不曉，妄增翟字耳，非本作紀之誤。」","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_26","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"五月，令田半租。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_27","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"秋七月，詔曰：「吏受所監臨，以飲食免，重；受財物，賤買貴賣，論輕。〔一〕廷尉與丞相更議著令。」〔二〕廷尉信謹與丞相議曰：〔三〕「吏及諸有秩受其官屬所監、所治、所行、所將，〔四〕其與飲食計償費，勿論。〔五〕它物，若買故賤，賣故貴，皆坐臧為盜，沒入臧縣官。〔六〕吏遷徙免罷，受其故官屬所將監治送財物，奪爵為士伍，免之。〔七〕無爵，罰金二斤，令沒入所受。有能捕告，畀其所受臧。」〔八〕","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_28","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「帝以為當時律條吏受所監臨賂遺飲食，即坐免官爵，於法太重，而受所監臨財物及賤買貴賣者，論決太輕，故令更議改之。」","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_29","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　蘇林曰：「著音著幘之著。」師古曰：「蘇音非也。著音著作之著，音竹箸反。」","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_30","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　師古曰：「丞相申屠嘉。」","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_31","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔四〕　師古曰：「行謂按察也，音下更反。」","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_32","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔五〕　師古曰：「計其所費，而償其直，勿論罪也。」","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_33","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔六〕　師古曰：「它物，謂非飲食者。」","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_34","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔七〕　李奇曰：「有爵者奪之，使為士伍，有位者免官也。」師古曰：「此說非也。謂奪其爵，令為士伍，又免其官職，即今律所謂除名也。謂之士伍者，言從士卒之伍也。」","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_35","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔八〕　師古曰：「畀，與也，以所受之臧與捕告者也。畀音必寐反。」","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_36","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"二年冬十二月，有星孛于西南。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_37","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"令天下男子年二十始傅。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_38","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「舊法二十三，今此二十，更為異制也。傅讀曰附。解在高紀。」","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_39","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"春三月，立皇子德為河間王，閼為臨江王，〔一〕餘為淮陽王，非為汝南王，彭祖為廣川王，發為長沙王。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_40","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「閼音一曷反。」","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_41","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"夏四月壬午，太皇太后崩。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_42","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　服虔曰：「文帝母薄太后也。」","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_43","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"六月，丞相嘉薨。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_44","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"封故相國蕭何孫係為列侯。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_45","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「係音胡計反。」","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_46","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"秋，與匈奴和親。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_47","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"三年冬十二月，詔曰：「襄平侯嘉〔一〕子恢說不孝，謀反，欲以殺嘉，大逆無道。〔二〕其赦嘉為襄平侯，及妻子當坐者復故爵。〔三〕論恢說及妻子如法。」","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_48","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　晉灼曰：「紀通子也。功臣表襄平侯紀通以父功侯，孝景三年，康侯相夫嗣。推其封薨，正與此合，豈更名嘉乎？」","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_49","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　晉灼曰：「恢說言嘉知反情，而實不知也。」師古曰：「此解非也。恢說有私怨於其父，而自謀反，欲令其父坐死也。說讀曰悅。」","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_50","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　如淳曰：「律，大逆不道，父母妻子同產皆棄市。今赦其餘子不與恢說謀者，復其故爵。」","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_51","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"春正月，淮陽王宮正殿災。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_52","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"吳王濞、膠西王卬、楚王戊、趙王遂、濟南王辟光、〔一〕菑川王賢、膠東王雄渠皆舉兵反。大赦天下。遣太尉亞夫、〔二〕大將軍竇嬰將兵擊之。斬御史大夫晁錯以謝七國。〔三〕","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_53","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「辟音壁，又音闢，其義兩通。」","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_54","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　師古曰：「周亞夫。」","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_55","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　晉灼曰：「錯音錯置之錯。」師古曰：「晁，古朝字。」","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_56","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"二月壬子晦，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_57","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"諸將破七國，斬首十餘萬級。追斬吳王濞於丹徒。膠西王卬、楚王戊、趙王遂、濟南王辟光、菑川王賢、膠東王雄渠皆自殺。夏六月，詔曰：「乃者吳王濞等為逆，起兵相脅，詿誤吏民，吏民不得已。〔一〕今濞等已滅，吏民當坐濞等及逋逃亡軍者，皆赦之。楚元王子蓺等與濞等為逆，〔二〕朕不忍加法，除其籍，毋令汙宗室。」立平陸侯劉禮為楚王，續元王後。〔三〕立皇子端為膠西王，勝為中山王。賜民爵一級。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_58","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「已，止也，言不得止而從之，非本心也。」","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_59","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　師古曰：「蓺音藝。」","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_60","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　孟康曰：「禮，元王子也。」","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_61","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"四年春，復置諸關用傳出入。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_62","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　應劭曰：「文帝十二年除關無用傳，至此復用傳。以七國新反，備非常。」","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_63","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"夏四月己巳，立皇子榮為皇太子，徹為膠東王。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_64","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"六月，赦天下，賜民爵一級。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_65","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"秋七月，臨江王閼薨。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_66","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"十月戊戌晦，日有蝕之。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_67","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"五年春正月，作陽陵邑。〔一〕夏，募民徙陽陵，賜錢二十萬。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_68","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　張晏曰：「景帝作壽陵，起邑。」","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_69","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"遣公主嫁匈奴單于。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_70","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"六年冬十二月，雷，霖雨。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_71","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"秋九月，皇后薄氏廢。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_72","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"七年冬十一月庚寅晦，日有蝕之。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_73","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"春正月，廢皇太子榮為臨江王。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_74","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"二月，罷太尉官。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_75","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"夏四月乙巳，立皇后王氏。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_76","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"丁巳，立膠東王徹為皇太子。賜民為父後者爵一級。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_77","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"中元年夏四月，赦天下，賜民爵一級。封故御史大夫周苛、周昌孫子為列侯。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_78","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「封苛之孫及昌之子也。苛、昌皆嘗為御史大夫而從昆弟也，故總言之。」","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_79","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"二年春二月，令諸侯王薨、列侯初封及之國，大鴻臚奏諡、誄、策。〔一〕列侯薨及諸侯太傅初除之官，大行奏諡、誄、策。〔二〕王薨，遣光祿大夫弔襚祠賵，〔三〕視喪事，因立嗣子。列侯薨，遣大中大夫弔祠，視喪事，因立嗣。其（薨）葬，國得發民輓喪，穿復土，治墳無過三百人畢事。〔四〕","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_80","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　應劭曰：「皇帝延諸侯王，賓王諸侯，皆屬大鴻臚。故其薨，奏其行跡，賜與諡及哀策誄文也。」臣瓚曰：「景帝此年已置大鴻臚，而百官表云武帝太初元年更以大行為大鴻臚，與此錯。」師古曰：「誄者，述累德行之文，音力水反。」","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_81","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　如淳曰：「凡言除者，除故官就新官也。」晉灼曰：「禮有大行人、小行人，主諡官，故以此名之。」臣瓚曰：「大行是官名，掌九儀之制以賓諸侯者。」師古曰：「大鴻臚者，本名典客，後改曰大鴻臚。大行令者，本名行人，即典客之屬官也，後改曰大行令。故事之尊重者遣大鴻臚，而輕賤者遣大行也。據此紀文，則景帝已改典客為大鴻臚，改行人為大行矣。而百官公卿表乃云景帝中六年更名典客為大行令，武帝太初元年更名大行令為大鴻臚，更名行人為大行令。當是表誤。」","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_82","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　應劭曰：「衣服曰襚。祠，飲食也。車馬曰賵。」師古曰：「襚音遂。賵音芳鳳反。」","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_83","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔四〕　師古曰：「輓謂引車也。畢事，畢葬事也。輓音晚。」","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_84","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"匈奴入燕。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_85","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"改磔曰棄市，〔一〕勿復磔。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_86","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　應劭曰：「先此諸死刑皆磔於市，今改曰棄市，自非妖逆不復磔也。」師古曰：「磔謂張其尸也。棄市，殺之於市也。謂之棄市者，取刑人於市，與眾棄之也。磔音竹客反。」","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_87","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"三月，臨江王榮坐侵太宗廟地，徵詣中尉，自殺。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_88","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"夏四月，有星孛于西北。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_89","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"立皇子越為廣川王，寄為膠東王。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_90","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"秋七月，更郡守為太守，郡尉為都尉。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_91","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「更謂改其號。」","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_92","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"九月，封故楚、趙傅相內史前死事者四人子〔一〕皆為列侯。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_93","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　文穎曰：「楚相張尚，太傅趙夷吾。趙相建德，內史王悍。此四人各諫其王無使反，不聽，皆殺之，故封其子。」","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_94","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"甲戌晦，日有蝕之。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_95","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"三年冬十一月，罷諸侯御史大夫官。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_96","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「所以抑損其權。」","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_97","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"春正月，皇太后崩。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_98","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　文穎曰：「景帝母竇太后，以帝崩後六年乃亡。凡立五十一年，武帝建元六年崩。今此言皇太后崩，誤耳。」孟康曰：「此太后崩，史記無也。」臣瓚曰：「王楙云景帝薄后以此年死，疑是也。當言廢后，而言太后，誤也。」師古曰：「孟說是也。廢后死不書，又不言崩。瓚解為謬。」","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_99","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"夏旱，禁酤酒。〔一〕秋九月，蝗。有星孛于西北。戊戌晦，日有蝕之。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_100","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「酤謂賣酒也，音工護反。」","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_101","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"立皇子乘為清河王。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_102","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"四年春三月，起德陽宮。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_103","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　臣瓚曰：「是景帝廟也。帝自作之，諱不言廟，故言宮。西京故事云景帝廟為德陽。」","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_104","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"立皇子乘為清河王。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_105","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"御史大夫綰奏禁馬高五尺九寸以上，齒未平，不得出關。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_106","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　服虔曰：「綰，衛綰也。馬十歲，齒下平。」","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_107","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"夏，蝗。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_108","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"秋，赦徒作陽陵者死罪；欲腐者，許之。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_109","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　蘇林曰：「宮刑，其創腐臭，故曰腐也。」如淳曰：「腐，宮刑也。丈夫割勢，不能復生子，如腐木不生實。」師古曰：「如說是。腐音輔。」","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_110","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"十月戊午，日有蝕之。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_111","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"五年夏，立皇子舜為常山王。六月，赦天下，賜民爵一級。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_112","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"秋八月己酉，未央宮東闕災。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_113","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"更名諸侯丞相為相。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_114","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「亦所以抑黜之，令異於漢朝。」","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_115","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"九月，詔曰：「法令度量，所以禁暴止邪也。獄，人之大命，死者不可復生。吏或不奉法令，以貨賂為市，朋黨比周，〔一〕以苛為察，以刻為明，令亡罪者失職，朕甚憐之。〔二〕有罪者不伏罪，姦法為暴，甚亡謂也。諸獄疑，若雖文致於法而於人心不厭者，輒讞之。」〔三〕","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_116","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「比音頻寐反。」","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_117","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　師古曰：「職，常也。失其常理也。」","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_118","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　師古曰：「厭，服也，音一贍反。讞，平議也，音魚列反。」","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_119","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"六年冬十月，行幸雍，郊五畤。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_120","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"十二月，改諸官名。定鑄錢偽黃金棄市律。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_121","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　應劭曰：「文帝五年，聽民放鑄，律尚未除。先時多作偽金，偽金終不可成，而徒損費，轉相誑耀，窮則起為盜賊，故定其律也。」孟康曰：「民先時多作偽金，故其語曰『金可作，世可度』。費損甚多而終不成。民亦稍知其意，犯者希，因此定律也。」師古曰：「應說是。」","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_122","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"春三月，雨雪。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_123","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「雨音于具反。」","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_124","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"夏四月，梁王薨，分梁為五國，立孝王子五人皆為王。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_125","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"五月，詔曰：「夫吏者，民之師也，車駕衣服宜稱。〔一〕吏六百石以上，皆長吏也，〔二〕亡度者或不吏服，出入閭里，與民亡異。令長吏二千石車朱兩轓，〔三〕千石至六百石朱左轓。車騎從者不稱其官衣服，下吏出入閭巷亡吏體者，二千石上其官屬，三輔舉不如法令者，〔四〕皆上丞相御史請之。」先是吏多軍功，車服尚輕，故為設禁。又惟酷吏奉憲失中，乃詔有司減笞法，定箠令。語在刑法志。〔五〕","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_126","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「稱其官也，音尺孕反。」","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_127","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　張晏曰：「長，大也。六百石，位大夫。」","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_128","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　應劭曰：「車耳反出，所以為之藩屏，翳塵泥也。二千石雙朱，其次乃偏其左。〈車反〉以簟為之，或用革。」如淳曰：「轓音反，小車兩屏也。」師古曰：「據許慎、李登說，轓，車之蔽也。左氏傳云『以藩載欒盈』，即是有鄣蔽之車也。言車耳反出，非矣。轓音甫元反。〈車反〉音方遠反。」","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_129","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔四〕　應劭曰：「京兆尹、左馮翊、右扶風共治長安城中，是為三輔。」師古曰：「時未有京兆、馮翊、扶風之名。此三輔者，謂主爵中尉及左右內史也。應說失之。」","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_130","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔五〕　師古曰：「箠音止蘂反。」","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_131","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"六月，匈奴入鴈門，至武泉，入上郡，取苑馬。〔一〕吏卒戰死者二千人。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_132","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　如淳曰：「漢儀注太僕牧師諸苑三十六所，分布北邊、西邊。以郎為苑監，官奴婢三萬人，養馬三十萬疋。」師古曰：「武泉，雲中之縣也。養鳥獸者通名為苑，故謂牧馬處為苑。」","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_133","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"秋七月辛亥晦，日有蝕之。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_134","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"後元年春正月，詔曰：「獄，重事也。人有智愚，官有上下。獄疑者讞有司。有司所不能決，移廷尉。有令讞而後不當，讞者不為失。〔一〕欲令治獄者務先寬。」三月，赦天下，賜民爵一級，中二千石諸侯相爵右庶長。〔二〕夏，大酺五日，民得酤酒。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_135","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「假令讞訖，其理不當，所讞之人不為罪失。」","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_136","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　如淳曰：「雖有尊官未必有高爵，故數有賜爵。」師古曰：「右庶長，第十二爵也。」","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_137","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"五月，地震。秋七月乙巳晦，日有蝕之。","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_138","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"條侯周亞夫下獄死。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_139","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"二年冬十月，省徹侯之國。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_140","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　晉灼曰：「文紀遣列侯之國，今省之。」師古曰：「省音所領反。」","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_141","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"春，匈奴入鴈門，太守馮敬與戰死。發車騎材官屯。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_142","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「屯鴈門。」","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_143","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"春，以歲不登，禁內郡食馬粟，沒入之。〔一〕","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_144","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「食讀曰飤。沒入者，沒入其馬。」","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_145","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"夏四月，詔曰：「雕文刻鏤，傷農事者也；錦繡纂組，害女紅者也。〔一〕農事傷則飢之本也，女紅害則寒之原也。夫飢寒並至，而能亡為非者寡矣。朕親耕，后親桑，以奉宗廟粢盛祭服，為天下先；不受獻，減太官，省繇賦，〔二〕欲天下務農蠶，素有畜積，以備災害。〔三〕彊毋攘弱，眾毋暴寡，〔四〕老耆以壽終，幼孤得遂長。〔五〕今歲或不登，民食頗寡，其咎安在？或詐偽為吏，〔六〕吏以貨賂為市，漁奪百姓，侵牟萬民。〔七〕縣丞，長吏也，奸法與盜盜，甚無謂也。〔八〕其令二千石修其職；不事官職耗亂者，丞相以聞，請其罪。〔九〕布告天下，使明知朕意。」","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_146","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　應劭曰：「纂，今五采屬綷是也。組者，今綬紛絛是也。」臣瓚曰：「許慎云『纂，赤組也』。」師古曰：「瓚說是也。綷，會也。會五綵者，今謂之錯綵，非纂也。紅讀曰功。綷音子內反。絛音它牢反。」","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_147","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　師古曰：「省音所領反。繇讀曰傜。」","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_148","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　師古曰：「畜讀曰蓄。」","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_149","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔四〕　師古曰：「攘，取也，音人羊反。」","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_150","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔五〕　師古曰：「遂，成也。」","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_151","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔六〕　張晏曰：「以詐偽人為吏也。」臣瓚曰：「律所謂矯枉以為吏者也。」師古曰：「二說並非也。直謂詐自稱吏耳。」","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_152","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔七〕　李奇曰：「牟，食苗根蟲也。侵牟食民，比之蛑賊也。」師古曰：「漁言若漁獵之為也。」","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_153","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔八〕　李斐曰：「奸法，因法作奸也。」文穎曰：「與盜，謂盜者當治，而知情反佐與之，是則共盜無異也。」師古曰：「與盜盜者，共盜為盜耳。」","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_154","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔九〕　師古曰：「耗，不明也，讀與眊同，音莫報反。」","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_155","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"五月，詔曰：「人不患其不知，患其為詐也；不患其不勇，患其為暴也；不患其不富，患其亡厭也。其唯廉士，寡欲易足。今訾算十以上乃得宦，〔一〕廉士算不必眾。有市籍不得宦，無訾又不得宦，朕甚愍之。訾算四得宦，亡令廉士久失職，貪夫長利。」〔二〕","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_156","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　服虔曰：「訾萬錢，算百二十七也。」應劭曰：「古者疾吏之貪，衣食足知榮辱，限訾十算乃得為吏。十算，十萬也。賈人有財不得為吏，廉士無訾又不得宦，故減訾四算得宦矣。」師古曰：「訾讀與貲同。他皆類此。」","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_157","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　師古曰：「長利，長獲其利。」","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_158","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"秋，大旱。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_159","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"三年春正月，詔曰：「農，天下之本也。黃金珠玉，飢不可食，寒不可衣，以為幣用，不識其終始。〔一〕間歲或不登，意為末者眾，農民寡也。其令郡國務勸農桑，益種樹，可得衣食物。〔二〕吏發民若取庸采黃金珠玉者，坐臧為盜。〔三〕二千石聽者，與同罪。」","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_160","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「幣者，所以通有無，易貴賤也。」","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_161","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　師古曰：「樹，殖也。」","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_162","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　韋昭曰：「發民，用其民。取庸，用其資以顧庸。」","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_163","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"皇太子冠，賜民為父後者爵一級。","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_164","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"甲子，帝崩于未央宮。〔一〕遺詔賜諸侯王列侯馬二駟，〔二〕吏二千石黃金二斤，吏民戶百錢。出宮人歸其家，復終身。〔三〕二月癸酉，葬陽陵。〔四〕","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_165","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　臣瓚曰：「帝年三十二即位，即位十六年，壽四十八。」","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_166","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　師古曰：「八匹也。」","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_167","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　師古曰：「復音方目反。」","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_168","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔四〕　臣瓚曰：「自崩及葬凡十日。陽陵在長安東北四十五里。」","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_169","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"贊曰：孔子稱「斯民，三代之所以直道而行也」，〔一〕信哉！周秦之敝，罔密文峻，而姦軌不勝。〔二〕漢興，掃除煩苛，與民休息。至于孝文，加之以恭儉，孝景遵業，五六十載之間，至於移風易俗，黎民醇厚。〔三〕周云成康，漢言文景，美矣！","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_170","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「此論語載孔子之辭也。言此今時之人，亦夏、殷、周之所馭，以政化淳壹，故能直道而行。傷今不然。」","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_171","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔二〕　師古曰：「不可勝。」","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_172","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"〔三〕　師古曰：「黎，眾也。醇，不澆雜。」","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_173","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"校勘記","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_6_174","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_6","textTraditional":"一四五頁　三行　其（薨）葬，　王念孫說「薨」字涉上文四「薨」字而衍。薨事已見上文，此文則專指葬事，故師古云「畢事，畢葬事也」。","sentenceOrder":174}],"overrides":{}}